{"page":129,"verses":[{"verse_key":"6:9","surah":6,"ayah":9,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَوْ جَعَلْنَـٰهُ مَلَكًا لَّجَعَلْنَـٰهُ رَجُلًا وَلَلَبَسْنَا عَلَيْهِم مَّا يَلْبِسُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Indeed, if We had sent an angel as messenger, We would still have sent him in the form of a man, so increasing their confusion.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"6:9"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَعَلْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"We had made him","transliteration":"jaʿalnāhu","verse_key":"6:9"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَلَكًۭا","en_gloss":"an Angel","transliteration":"malakan","verse_key":"6:9"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَّجَعَلْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"certainly We (would) have made him","transliteration":"lajaʿalnāhu","verse_key":"6:9"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رَجُلًۭا","en_gloss":"a man","transliteration":"rajulan","verse_key":"6:9"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلَلَبَسْنَا","en_gloss":"and certainly We (would) have obscured","transliteration":"walalabasnā","verse_key":"6:9"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَلَيْهِم","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"6:9"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"6:9"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَلْبِسُونَ","en_gloss":"they are obscuring","transliteration":"yalbisūna","verse_key":"6:9"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٩","en_gloss":"(9)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:9"}]},{"verse_key":"6:10","surah":6,"ayah":10,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدِ ٱسْتُهْزِئَ بِرُسُلٍ مِّن قَبْلِكَ فَحَاقَ بِٱلَّذِينَ سَخِرُوا۟ مِنْهُم مَّا كَانُوا۟ بِهِۦ يَسْتَهْزِءُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Messengers have been mocked before you [Muhammad], and those who mocked them were engulfed by the very punishment they had mocked.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدِ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"walaqadi","verse_key":"6:10"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱسْتُهْزِئَ","en_gloss":"were mocked","transliteration":"us'tuh'zi-a","verse_key":"6:10"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِرُسُلٍۢ","en_gloss":"Messengers","transliteration":"birusulin","verse_key":"6:10"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"6:10"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَبْلِكَ","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"qablika","verse_key":"6:10"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَحَاقَ","en_gloss":"but surrounded","transliteration":"faḥāqa","verse_key":"6:10"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"bi-alladhīna","verse_key":"6:10"},{"pos":8,"ar":"سَخِرُوا۟","en_gloss":"scoffed","transliteration":"sakhirū","verse_key":"6:10"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِنْهُم","en_gloss":"of them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"6:10"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"6:10"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they used to","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"6:10"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"[at it]","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"6:10"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَسْتَهْزِءُونَ","en_gloss":"mock","transliteration":"yastahziūna","verse_key":"6:10"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١٠","en_gloss":"(10)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:10"}]},{"verse_key":"6:11","surah":6,"ayah":11,"ar_uthmani":"قُلْ سِيرُوا۟ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ ثُمَّ ٱنظُرُوا۟ كَيْفَ كَانَ عَـٰقِبَةُ ٱلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Say, ‘Travel throughout the earth and see what fate befell those who rejected the truth.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"6:11"},{"pos":2,"ar":"سِيرُوا۟","en_gloss":"Travel","transliteration":"sīrū","verse_key":"6:11"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"6:11"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"6:11"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"and","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"6:11"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱنظُرُوا۟","en_gloss":"see","transliteration":"unẓurū","verse_key":"6:11"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كَيْفَ","en_gloss":"how","transliteration":"kayfa","verse_key":"6:11"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"was","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"6:11"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَـٰقِبَةُ",